 article.</p><h2 style="font:400 24px/1.4 Georgia,serif;color:#4a002e;margin:28px 0 14px">A place in the beginning</h2><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px">Chateau Follent is a small Australian wine and mead project led by Lord James Follent. We are learning, refining and sharing each vintage on the journey towards a vineyard and winery. Thank you for bringing your curiosity to its next chapter.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px">With warm regards,<br>The Chateau Follent Team</p>{% else %}<h2 style="font:400 24px/1.4 Georgia,serif;color:#4a002e;margin:28px 0 14px">Your Wine Profile</h2><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px">Your personalised profile could not be loaded for this message. Please return to the quiz to view your results.</p><a href="{{ shop.url }}/pages/wine-profile">Open the Wine Profile</a>{% endif %}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:24px;background:#0a0a0c;color:#f2f0ea;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7">For adults aged 18 and over. A reflection of your stated preferences, not a measurement of tasting ability.<br><a style="color:#f2f0ea" href="{{ shop.url }}">Chateau Follent</a> · <a style="color:#f2f0ea" href="{{ shop.url }}/policies/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a><br><a style="color:#f2f0ea" href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}">Unsubscribe</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>{{ open_tracking_block }}</body></html>